+to their existing `http` constants. Other spellings and custom names retain
+`HeaderName::from_bytes`; syntax/framing, header-case preservation and duplicate
+field semantics are unchanged. A differential test covers case variants and
+invalid tokens. The H1 header deadline implementation remains unchanged; the
+lazy-arming trial did not demonstrate a benefit in the sequential workload.
